# Goal: drive the turtle to a pose
lab1_interfaces/TargetPose target
---
# Result
bool success
float32 distance_error   # final position error
float32 yaw_error        # final heading error (rad)
string message
---
# Feedback
float32 distance_remaining
float32 angle_remaining  # heading error while moving, yaw error during the final rotation
string phase             # rotate_to_heading | drive | rotate_to_yaw
